# Enemy art palette: 80s anime, Akira (1988) colours, flat cel style.
# The single source for every colour in svg/*.svg (written there as @NAME@
# and substituted by render.sh). Values come from docs/art-samples/src/akira.py
# plus the per-world families from docs/art-style.md 1.3.
#
# Enemies are cold, sickly or hostile. The player's Kaneda red (RED, RED_SH,
# RED_HI) means "friendly" and is deliberately absent; EnemyArtTest fails if
# it ever shows up here. Runtime tints that must match live in
# Scripts/Gameplay/Enemies/EnemyPalette.cs; EnemyArtTest checks the two agree.
#
# Ink + highlight
INK=#140C14
BONE=#F4EAD4
FLASH_SH=#C9BCD8
# Neutral machine metal (mine clamps, lugs)
GUN=#2C2D40
GUN_SH=#1A1A28
GUN_HI=#5A5C78
# Enemy family: steel, bruise, bile
STEEL=#5A6A88
STEEL_SH=#262D44
STEEL_HI=#A3B4CC
BRUISE=#74409A
BRUISE_SH=#3A1E52
BRUISE_HI=#A86CD0
BILE=#8FA84E
BILE_SH=#3E5229
BILE_HI=#D4E68E
BILE_LIGHT=#C8FF3A
# Hazard rock (Space)
ROCK=#605878
ROCK_SH=#2C2638
ROCK_HI=#958AA4
# Lights
MAGENTA=#FF2E88
MAGENTA_SH=#8E1450
CYAN=#6EF2EE
TEAL=#1FB5B9
TEAL_SH=#0F5E6A
AMBER=#FFB43C
SODIUM=#F2862B
SODIUM_SH=#A9481A
# Frost: ice
ICE=#6AAED0
ICE_SH=#2C557E
ICE_HI=#CDF4F8
# Verdant: bark + moss
BARK=#7A5A3E
BARK_SH=#36261E
BARK_HI=#B08A62
MOSS=#6E9A5A
# Ember: basalt char + obsidian
CHAR=#6A5462
CHAR_SH=#2A1C26
CHAR_HI=#A08A9A
OBSIDIAN=#3C3570
